<p>
  NWAPRS has been holding the Summer Gathering, the pacific northwest's premier and longest-running digital radio conference, since 1997. Held annually on the weekend following Labor Day in September, the event held at Valley Camp in North Bend WA offers visitors a place to relax and enjoy the outdoors while attending APRS and digital-radio related lectures and demonstrations. Plenty of camping, tent, and RV spots are available.<br />
  <a href="https://wa7vc.org/summergathering" class="text-signal-400 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-signal-300">Learn more about this event.</a>
</p>

<p>If your club or group is hosting an APRS-related event in the region, let us know so it can be listed here.</p>
